  "text": "\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nHoliday Lake Rural Improvement Zone (August 4, 2026) - Elections - Poweshiek County, Iowa\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n\n Poweshiek County, Iowa\n Election Central\n \n \n\n \n\n Contact Us\n \n \n\n \n \nHome\n \nVote \n \n \nRegister to Vote\n \nAbsentee Voting\n \nMaps\n \nMilitary/Overseas Voting\n \nPrecincts\n \nVoter ID\n \n \n \nElections \n \n \nUpcoming Elections\n \nPast Elections\n \nSample Ballots\n \nPrecinct Election Officials\n \nTypes of Elections\n \n \n \nElected Officials \n \n \nFederal\n \nState\n \nCounty\n \nCity\n \nRural Improvement Zone\n \nSchool Board\n \nTownship\n \n \n \nCandidates\n \nNews\n \nFAQ\n \n \n \n\n \n\n\n\n\n Poweshiek County\nElections\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \nElections Holiday Lake Rural Improvement Zone\n \n\n\n\n\n \n\n \nElections by Year\n\n \n2026 \n2025 \n2024 \n2023 \n2022 \n2021 \n2020 \n2019 \n2018 \n2017 \n2016 \nView All\n\n\nElections\n\n \nUpcoming Elections\n \nPast Elections\n \nSample Ballots\n \nPrecinct Election Officials\n \nTypes of Elections\n\n \n \n\n \nHoliday Lake Rural Improvement Zone\n\n \nAugust 4, 2026\n Special Election \n \n\n A Special Election is any election that is not regularly scheduled. A special election may be held for any purpose authorized or required by law; often to fill a vacancy or for a public measure. \n\n \n \n \n \n\n \nElection Results\n \n\n Download Official Results\n \n \n\n \n \n\n \n \n \n\n\n\n\n \n \n \nArchived Election Details\n \nPUBLIC NOTICE is hereby given that a Special Election will be held Tuesday, August 4, 2026, for the County of Poweshiek, Iowa, Rural Improvement Zone permanent residents of Holiday Lake only. \n \n\nPolls will open at 12:00 o’clock p.m. (Noon) and close at 8:00 o’clock p.m. \n \n\nPolling place is as follows: \n \n\n*Holiday Lake – Community Center, 6A Lakeshore Dr, Brooklyn, IA \n \n\nAbsentee Ballots are available from the Poweshiek County Auditor, Melissa Eilander beginning on July 15, 2026 for the Special Rural Improvement Zone Election to be held on August 4, 2026 for permanent residents of Holiday Lake. \n \n\nAuditor's Office is open Monday - Friday from 8:00 am to 4:00 pm for voting absentee prior to Election Day. \n \n \n\n \nSample Ballots (PDF)\n \n\n Holiday Lake Rural Improvement Zone\n \n \n\n \nBack: Past Elections\n \n \n\n\n\n\nThis webpage was printed on October 17, 2026. For the most current election-related information, visit the Poweshiek County, Iowa, Elections website at https://poweshiekcounty.iowa.gov.\n\n\n \n\n Poweshiek County Courthouse\n\n 302 East Main\n \nP.O. Box 57\n \nMontezuma, IA 50171\n\n Contact Us\n\n Accessibility\n\n Poweshiek County Website\n \n \nOffice Hours\n\n 8:00 a.m. to 4:00 p.m.\n \nMonday through Friday \n \nContact Information\n\n (641) 623-5443 \n \n\n \n\n Contact Us\n \n\n \n \n\n\n\n\n \npowered by \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"
